	•	Section 2 Comments/Quotes: The Results state: “Of the 41 patients referred to the multimodal rehabilitation program (mean age of 55.8 [SD 9.7] years; 22 men).” This implies 19 women, or 46.3%. Table 1 reports comorbidity and clinical-history-related variables including Charlson Comorbidity Index, transplant indication, malnutrition, sarcopenia, muscle strength, exercise capacity, and quality of life. Race/ethnicity was not reported.

