	•	Section 3 Comments/Quotes: The paper explicitly states this was a “prospective observational study” and that “an ANN and regression analysis were used.” The ANN was implemented in R using the nnet package, with “30 neurons, a decay of 0.001, ‘tanh’ activator, and linear output relationships,” so architecture details were reported. Garson’s algorithm was used to quantify variable contribution and select variables with relative importance >0.5 for subsequent regression, which supports both explainability and automated feature selection. No explicit train/validation/test split or cross-validation was reported.

